Yes. The current ecosystem is much better than it was a few months ago. For Stealth, I’d separate providers into **(A) uncensored/reduced-refusal**, **(B) verifiable TEE/private inference**, and **(C) the rare overlap where you get both**.

The strongest overlap I found right now is **Phala/RedPill, Venice, and a few newer providers exposing uncensored open-weight models through confidential infrastructure**.

