# What I'd actually configure for Stealth

I would give the app **four inference modes**, rather than forcing users to understand providers:

```text
FAST
cheap open model
Chutes / NanoGPT

PRIVATE
attested TEE
Chutes / Tinfoil / Confidential.ai

PRIVATE + UNCENSORED
Phala/RedPill / Venice

LOCAL
user-hosted model
nothing leaves device
```

And internally every model gets capability metadata:

```yaml
model:
  provider: phala
  id: qwen3.6-35b-uncensored

privacy:
  tee: true
  attestation: true
  e2ee: false
  retention: none

behavior:
  reduced_refusal: true

capabilities:
  tools: true
  vision: false
  reasoning: true
```

Then Stealth can route automatically.

